# When Duskmourn's Domination is destroyed (Bot2's Disenchant), Bot1 stops controlling Serra Angel, which goes back to Bot2 as a 4/4 with flying
# and vigilance again (CR 613.1b, 303.4, 400.7 not applying - it never left the battlefield).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Duskmourn's Domination
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Serra Angel
Disenchant
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Serra Angel.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
